# Browsers the build targets for JS and CSS output (esbuild and autoprefixer).
# This is Angular 20's browser support policy; browsers outside it are ignored by the build with a warning,
# so raise these minimums together with Angular majors (see node_modules/@angular/build/.browserslistrc).
#
# To list the browsers these queries select: npx browserslist

Chrome >= 107
ChromeAndroid >= 107
Edge >= 107
Firefox >= 104
FirefoxAndroid >= 104
Safari >= 16
iOS >= 16
